msgid "PR-template checklist"
msgstr "PRテンプレートチェックリスト"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md
msgid "Structural drift detection"
msgstr "構造的ドリフト検出"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md
