msgstr "CI強制（自動）"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md
msgid "Zero-cost / GitHub-native"
msgstr "ゼロコスト / GitHubネイティブ"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md
msgid "Minimal maintenance burden"
msgstr "最小限の保守負担"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md
msgid "Catches swapped key assignments"
msgstr "入れ替わったキー割り当ての検出"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:134
msgid "Links"
msgstr "リンク"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:136
msgid ""
"Parent issue: [#441](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-"
"wasm/issues/441) (Update English slide locale to match newest Japanese "
"content)"
msgstr ""
"親issue: [#441](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-wasm/issues/441)"
"（最新の日本語コンテンツに一致するように英語スライドロケールを更新する）"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:137
msgid ""
"This decision: [#442](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-"
"wasm/issues/442)"
msgstr ""
"この決定: [#442](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-wasm/issues/442)"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:138
msgid ""
"Related: [ADR-0003](0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-"
"deck.md) (established the i18n structure with separate YAML locale files)"
msgstr ""
"関連: [ADR-0003](0003-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-slidev-deck.md)"
"（別々のYAMLロケールファイルでi18n構造を確立した）"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:139
msgid ""
"Related: [ADR-0004](0004-adopt-one-slide-one-message-principle.md) "
"(governs slide content density, which affects when locale keys change)"
msgstr ""
"関連: [ADR-0004](0004-adopt-one-slide-one-message-principle.md)"
"（スライドコンテンツの密度を統治し、ロケールキーが変更されるタイミングに影響する）"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:140
msgid ""
"Related: [#439](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-wasm/issues/439) "
"(ADR-0008 — deciding how to internationalize the ReadTheDocs "
"documentation)"
msgstr ""
"関連: [#439](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-wasm/issues/439)"
"（ADR-0008 — ReadTheDocsドキュメントの国際化方法の決定）"

#: ../../decisions/0006-decide-how-to-sync-slide-locale-files.md:141
msgid ""
"Existing pre-commit configuration: [`.pre-commit-config.yaml"
"`](../../.pre-commit-config.yaml)"
msgstr ""
"既存のpre-commit設定: [`.pre-commit-config.yaml"
"`](../../.pre-commit-config.yaml)"
